<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-10T10:08:44.372Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:08:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Heavy rains are flooding tens of thousands of displacement tents across Gaza, damaging structures already weakened by bombings and prompting gunfire that struck tents at the Rafah site as aid teams prepare for winter storms. A sand embankment collapsed in Gaza, killing a woman and injuring several people. Israeli forces deported fourteen foreign pro-Palestinian activists arrested in the West Bank during the olive harvest and seized eight Palestinian homes in Jericho, displacing dozens of residents. The United Nations reported 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/10/firms-tied-to-west-bank-settlements-win-15m-uk-deals-despite-sanctions?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168740&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNWlM1ekQ5cWFWN042SGU3V2oxS1R3d2N2M0xRWlJMeVFxX0N2M1FPSm02TVJ1T3Nyb25JQngya25WX2VxWVhlSGZfdEJrMTVxdXV6by1wa2dXckt1QjJHM003TDVnNXM3QTNfV3NEdmVpR1hjMlNxNkNrTVFDa1Nfd0lmQnNyWGI3Znh6eXBfTHR0VGJTVl9MR2tZVmxQNl9ZY0VYblFsTEZMcHlJOTBzNGkyUi1FeldJczVsYVpPUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
